WEBVTT

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:28.090
A curse upon you.

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:30.340
Ow, ow, ow... My guts hurt!

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.800
A curse upon you...

00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:36.920
Someone...

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:38.060
Help!

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:43.100
Now you'll see some real horror.

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:21.210
There's no one quite as amazing as me.

00:02:21.210 --> 00:02:23.910
How am I so great?

00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:29.290
I am a man of incomprehensible, 
superhuman potential!

00:02:30.050 --> 00:02:33.440
One shouldn't compare me to the 
kind of peons you see everywhere.

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:35.470
And to top it off, I'm so handsome!

00:02:35.470 --> 00:02:36.870
Hey, did you hear?

00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:39.840
Ouya-kun from Class 3 passed out
in the street last night.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:43.300
They say he's hospitalized now.

00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:48.000
Oh, really?

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:52.690
I wonder what happened
to poor Ouya-kun...

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:57.530
Ouya thought he was hot stuff,

00:02:57.530 --> 00:02:59.610
so I had to teach him a little lesson.

00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:02.910
But that's a secret!

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:08.340
After all, we can't have everyone
finding out how amazing I am.

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:13.750
The peons of this class are convinced
that I'm a perfectly ordinary boy.

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:14.990
Although, even then...

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:19.900
I still can't seem to escape 
the adoration of the girls.

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:22.180
He's giggling...

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:23.800
He really isn't normal.

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:25.750
And that gloomy face of his creeps me out.

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:27.510
You just don't get it!

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:29.600
You got a problem?!

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:31.570
Screw you! Apologize!

00:03:31.570 --> 00:03:33.410
You apologize!

00:03:31.570 --> 00:03:34.670
Kuroda-kun and Akiyama-kun are fighting.

00:03:33.410 --> 00:03:35.700
Why?! It's your fault!

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:37.570
The two of them have never gotten along.

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:37.580
What?! It's obviously yours!

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:39.130
I'm gonna slug you, man!

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:41.030
Go ahead, if you've got the guts!

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:46.200
Shut up!

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:49.950
And a new hatred has been born...

00:03:56.770 --> 00:04:00.600
Despite how I might seem, I'm actually 
quite a kind-hearted young man.

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:01.840
For instance,

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:07.090
if you dig up a bit of dirt
on a wintry day like this...

00:04:07.090 --> 00:04:10.810
You'll often find a hibernating 
toad, just like this.

00:04:11.090 --> 00:04:12.530
There, there.

00:04:12.530 --> 00:04:15.770
It must've been chilly in that dirt, huh?

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:18.740
How about you come home with me?

00:04:18.890 --> 00:04:21.430
It's nice and warm!

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:23.790
See?

00:04:23.790 --> 00:04:26.410
This is your new house.

00:04:26.690 --> 00:04:29.200
There's even some water for you.

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:35.330
<i>So, let's sit down.</i>

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:36.860
<i>That's a great idea,</i>

00:04:36.860 --> 00:04:40.880
<i>if I want to make my
hemorrhoids hurt like hell!</i>

00:04:38.370 --> 00:04:39.900
Oh, my!

00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:44.690
The whole family's happily
sitting around after dinner, eh?

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:46.300
Good for them.

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:48.180
That's Kouichi.

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:50.600
Pitiful bastard with 
pretensions of seriousness,

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:54.110
always trying to play the big brother
in a way that's frankly intolerable.

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:57.520
This is my older sister, named Sayuri,

00:04:57.520 --> 00:05:01.210
and the poor girl seems to have
convinced herself she's a beauty.

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:05.520
There's honestly nothing noteworthy enough
to comment on in regards to this trio.

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:09.240
What a dull bunch!

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:12.910
Souichi.

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:16.250
If you want to watch TV with us,
just come in and do it.

00:05:16.930 --> 00:05:18.880
If not, then close the sliding door.

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:19.960
It's cold.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:21.850
Son of a bitch...

00:05:21.850 --> 00:05:25.720
I'll make you suffer for your idiocy one day.

00:05:25.900 --> 00:05:27.380
Did you say something?!

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:29.550
No, nothing...

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:31.220
I heard him.

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:32.890
He said you were stupid.

00:05:33.460 --> 00:05:34.400
What?!

00:05:35.090 --> 00:05:36.940
Damned Sayuri!

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:39.890
Souichi, how am I stupid?!

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:48.810
Look here, Sayuri!

00:05:48.810 --> 00:05:51.240
It's your favorite, a toad!

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:53.090
Stop that, Souichi!

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:56.610
Cut it out, Souichi!

00:05:57.420 --> 00:05:58.780
Do you see now?

00:05:58.780 --> 00:06:01.220
I'm not a peon like the rest of you,

00:06:01.220 --> 00:06:04.680
I'm wanted— No, I'm even wonted!

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:06.140
You should all bow down!

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:08.660
You're wonted, huh?

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:13.560
<b>New Edition 
Dictionary</b>

00:06:11.410 --> 00:06:13.560
"Wonted:"

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:15.830
"Average, commonplace."

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:17.200
What?!

00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:18.970
Damn you, Kouichi!

00:06:18.970 --> 00:06:21.200
How dare you embarrass me?!

00:06:21.890 --> 00:06:24.100
Not that it matters.

00:06:24.100 --> 00:06:26.270
I don't have time for this nonsense.

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:29.570
I've got a new project, after all.

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:31.890
I should get to work on it right away...

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:35.320
What kind of curse would be good, I wonder...

00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:37.920
I know...

00:06:38.110 --> 00:06:41.380
A hibernation curse should do nicely.

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:55.300
Now, Kuroda-kun, time to go to sleep.

00:06:57.180 --> 00:07:01.410
You can come out when
spring rolls around...

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:05.810
Hey, did you hear?

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:08.110
<b>Class 6-1</b>

00:07:05.810 --> 00:07:08.620
You know Kuroda's been absent 
for a few days now, right?

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:10.930
Seems he went missing.

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:12.010
Did he run away?

00:07:12.010 --> 00:07:13.050
Get kidnapped?

00:07:13.050 --> 00:07:14.750
Maybe he got killed.

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:16.290
Don't even joke about that!

00:07:16.820 --> 00:07:17.830
Hey, Akiyama...

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:20.990
You were fighting with Kuroda.

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:22.370
Did you hear anything?

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:24.800
How would I know?

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:38.640
Again?!

00:07:39.190 --> 00:07:40.840
It keeps happening lately!

00:07:40.840 --> 00:07:43.830
Driving damned nails into my cedar trees!

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:45.730
If this is a prank, it's gone too far!

00:07:46.300 --> 00:07:49.410
I'm not putting up with this anymore!

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:52.810
I'll be the one who nails 
whoever's responsible!

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:56.210
Eh?

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:03.520
Now, what the hell is this?

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:08.450
Damn it.

00:08:13.400 --> 00:08:14.610
What the...

00:08:17.190 --> 00:08:20.100
Well, what's this supposed to be?

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:22.590
A mannequin's head?

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:28.690
It's a person!

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:33.200
They found Kuroda!

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:36.470
He was buried up to his head
in the cedar forest.

00:08:36.470 --> 00:08:38.080
So was he dead?

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:40.270
No, just asleep.

00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:43.210
They took him to the hospital,
and then he woke up.

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:45.370
Asleep in the dirt?

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:49.650
You're saying he was asleep for days, 
in the dirt, in this freezing weather?

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:52.000
What the hell?!

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:57.040
It was going to be so funny when
he crawled out of the dirt in spring!

00:08:57.040 --> 00:08:59.120
Damn it!

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:02.900
Kuroda says he doesn't
remember what happened, either.

00:09:03.360 --> 00:09:04.590
What a weirdo.

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:06.820
Did he think he was a snake
or a frog or something?

00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:11.850
<i>Something's odd about those three...</i>

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:15.570
<i>They look like they're
having a friendly chat,</i>

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:18.200
<i>but there's an air of oddness today.</i>

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:22.580
<i>I do believe there's been a change in 
the status quo for this trio of pals.</i>

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:25.160
<i>Just take a close look.</i>

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:28.730
<i>Yamada and Kawai are talking like normal,</i>

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:33.300
<i>but Kawai and Ishizaka aren't
saying much to each other for once.</i>

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:34.170
<b>(Ishizaka) Second most active (Yamada) Most active
(Kawai) Least active</b>

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:34.170
<b>Conversation</b>

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:34.170
<i>Which means...</i>

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:37.760
<i>Something awkward must've happened!</i>

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:42.600
<i>Some kind of heinous, hideous muck 
has been raked up in their hearts!</i>

00:09:42.800 --> 00:09:46.320
<i>The four-eyed Ishizaka getting pushed
around by the outgoing Kawai...</i>

00:09:46.320 --> 00:09:48.610
<i>That's where hate is born!</i>

00:09:48.610 --> 00:09:49.380
<i>That's it!</i>

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:51.990
<i>Ishizaka must hate Kawai!</i>

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:55.910
<i>He hates him from
the bottom of his heart!</i>

00:09:55.910 --> 00:09:57.590
I've gotta use the bathroom.

00:09:59.390 --> 00:10:00.600
Ishizaka-kun!

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:01.890
Ishizaka-kun?

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:05.000
Oh, it's you, Souichi-kun.

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:06.270
Can I help you?

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:07.780
It must be so hard.

00:10:07.780 --> 00:10:09.740
What must be hard?

00:10:09.740 --> 00:10:11.460
I understand...

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:14.220
To curse someone is a difficult thing.

00:10:14.220 --> 00:10:18.670
And you hate Kawai-kun so much, 
you want to see him dead, right?

00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:20.470
You curse him, don't you?

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:22.670
But there's no need to worry.

00:10:22.670 --> 00:10:25.200
Just leave Kawai to me!

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:28.440
I'll curse him in your stead.

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:33.940
What the hell? Souichi said that?

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:36.990
Don't pay that freak any mind.

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:40.200
He said he was going
to curse you, though.

00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:42.290
Sounds like fun!

00:10:42.980 --> 00:10:44.450
Hey, check it out.

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:49.710
It's that psycho landowner...

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:54.130
Damn it.

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:56.760
Here.

00:10:57.440 --> 00:10:59.720
It's foreign, and expensive.

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:01.680
I appreciate it.

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:03.580
Very nice.

00:11:03.580 --> 00:11:04.870
I like it.

00:11:04.870 --> 00:11:09.300
I think I'll head home and have
a little walk around the attic.

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:12.010
See you later.

00:11:18.600 --> 00:11:19.490
No!

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:22.160
Stay away from me!

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:27.780
I found this in the attic. It's the remains 
of a giant gold orb weaver!

00:11:27.780 --> 00:11:29.100
Go on and eat it up!

00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:30.140
It's delicious!

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:31.370
Stop screwing around!

00:11:31.880 --> 00:11:34.450
Souichi, what are you doing now?!

00:11:34.450 --> 00:11:36.080
Onii-chan, do something about him!

00:11:36.440 --> 00:11:39.390
Why are you always pulling crap like this?

00:11:39.390 --> 00:11:41.410
Throw that thing outside now!

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:43.800
I'm not just gonna throw it away!

00:11:44.210 --> 00:11:46.900
Just look at these long legs!

00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:49.160
It's so beautiful!

00:11:49.160 --> 00:11:50.050
Enough!

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:52.210
Eep!

00:11:53.590 --> 00:11:54.960
Hey, Sayuri...

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:56.960
Did you just hear him go "Eep"?

00:11:56.960 --> 00:11:57.720
Yeah!

00:11:58.220 --> 00:11:59.340
Well, well.

00:11:59.340 --> 00:12:02.010
Maybe he's more scared
of spiders than he lets on.

00:12:02.010 --> 00:12:03.660
Wh-What are you doing?

00:12:04.800 --> 00:12:06.430
See? See?

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:07.300
Look!

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:09.780
I can't believe you're handling 
it bare-handed! Gross!

00:12:09.780 --> 00:12:11.040
Talk about nasty!

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:18.660
I'm not some stupid kid.

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:21.630
I don't have time to waste
with this nonsense.

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:24.560
I have another new project.

00:12:24.560 --> 00:12:28.270
I wonder which curse it should be this time...

00:12:28.610 --> 00:12:29.880
I know.

00:12:29.880 --> 00:12:32.810
Something with spiders will do nicely.

00:12:33.970 --> 00:12:35.890
"In Japan for the first time in a year,

00:12:35.890 --> 00:12:37.940
in my home for the first time in a year.

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:40.290
It would be natural to feel relieved now,

00:12:40.290 --> 00:12:42.410
but I find it disturbing.

00:12:42.410 --> 00:12:45.910
The reason being that someone else 
has lived here during that time.

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:48.000
Worse yet is the fact that it was

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:50.290
the family of my middle school teacher.

00:12:48.930 --> 00:12:50.290
S-Sensei!

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:52.370
This house that had still been new—"

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:52.370
What is it, Kawai?

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:57.410
Damn it, talk about embarrassing...

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:02.400
Huh?

00:13:02.400 --> 00:13:05.650
That's weird. My stomach 
doesn't hurt anymore.

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:08.340
I should've just held on, if it was nothing...

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:09.800
Huh?

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:12.260
It's not opening.

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:15.860
What is this?

00:13:15.860 --> 00:13:17.580
What's going on?!

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:18.610
Hey!

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:24.440
Guess I'll climb out.

00:13:55.490 --> 00:13:58.010
He was passed out in 
the bathroom, apparently.

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:02.730
And he was wrapped
head to toe in toilet paper!

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:06.020
How's that, Ishizaka-kun?

00:14:06.020 --> 00:14:08.750
Satisfied with the result?

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:09.940
What are you talking about?

00:14:09.940 --> 00:14:14.960
No, no, it's not like I expect anything in return.

00:14:14.960 --> 00:14:19.170
All I did was teach
Kawai-kun a lesson for you.

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:21.920
As long as you're happy, that's enough.

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:24.400
Don't get the wrong idea, though.

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:27.290
The service I've performed 
for you is worthy of pay,

00:14:27.290 --> 00:14:33.380
but I'm not the kind of petty guy who'd
demand money or stuff from you.

00:14:33.690 --> 00:14:35.900
No need for thanks.

00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:38.290
Really, none at all!

00:14:38.740 --> 00:14:40.180
No thanks necessary—

00:14:40.180 --> 00:14:41.300
Souichi-kun,

00:14:41.300 --> 00:14:43.800
what the heck are you babbling about?

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:45.780
What do you mean,
you taught Kawai a lesson?

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:48.230
What's going on, Ishizaka?

00:14:48.230 --> 00:14:50.240
Nothing important, I guess...

00:14:50.970 --> 00:14:52.840
Damn you, Ishizaka!

00:14:52.840 --> 00:14:54.630
Not only do you show no gratitude,

00:14:54.630 --> 00:14:56.400
but you embarrass me, too?

00:14:56.400 --> 00:14:59.190
Don't think you'll get away with this.

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:04.210
Hello, Ishizaka residence.

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:07.850
<i>Uh, yes, is this Ishizaka Yasuo-san?</i>

00:15:07.850 --> 00:15:09.380
Yes, that's me.

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:11.050
<i>Congratulations!</i>

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:13.350
<i>You're very lucky, sir!</i>

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:17.940
You've been selected for the chance 
to win a free trip around the world!

00:15:17.940 --> 00:15:19.130
If you could,

00:15:19.130 --> 00:15:23.230
please come to Sakurayama Park next to 
the elementary school, alone, right away!

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:25.530
We can hash out the details there!

00:15:25.530 --> 00:15:27.320
Be sure to show up, all right?

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:32.560
That idiot. He's actually coming.

00:15:32.560 --> 00:15:34.990
I'd better get everything ready!

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:40.350
That was obviously Souichi's voice...

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:42.500
I don't know what that idiot's planning,

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:44.500
but I'm ready for it.

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:48.910
So cold... and late...

00:15:48.910 --> 00:15:51.300
If he's coming, he needs
to show up already!

00:15:59.120 --> 00:16:00.600
What is that thing?!

00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:24.210
It followed me into the woods!

00:16:49.010 --> 00:16:50.820
You're... Souichi?!

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:55.090
Damn you, Ishizaka, you tricked me!

00:16:55.090 --> 00:16:57.950
Setting a trap like that... You coward!

00:16:57.950 --> 00:16:58.700
Hey, stupid!

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:01.580
That trap was set by the angry
old man who owns this property!

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:04.170
There's no telling what he'll
do to you if he finds you!

00:17:04.170 --> 00:17:05.880
Wh-What?!

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:08.130
What are you trying to say?

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:11.690
I'm saying you'd better run. 
This one's not on me!

00:17:11.690 --> 00:17:13.420
I don't wanna run into that old psycho,

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:15.210
so I'm getting out of here.

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:25.220
The bastard actually left me...

00:17:25.220 --> 00:17:29.600
Abandoning me like this and going home... 
He should be ashamed of himself.

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:34.990
Damn it!

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:37.000
My leg's stuck!

00:17:58.900 --> 00:18:01.970
What the hell are you doing 
up there, you little bastard?!

00:18:05.440 --> 00:18:07.780
Pretending to be a cat isn't gonna help!

00:18:07.780 --> 00:18:11.340
You're the one who's been vandalizing
my cedar trees, aren't you?!

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:13.210
I'm gonna tear you apart!

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:14.690
Die!

00:18:17.090 --> 00:18:18.980
Spare me!

00:18:20.210 --> 00:18:22.500
Screaming isn't gonna help you.

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:23.950
Tonight, you die.

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:25.410
Show some mercy!

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:27.640
Whatever you do, don't kill me!

00:18:27.640 --> 00:18:30.500
Mommy, help!

00:18:31.120 --> 00:18:34.030
It's what you get for messing with my cedars!

00:18:34.030 --> 00:18:35.700
What's wrong, sir?

00:18:36.570 --> 00:18:38.670
Who are you supposed to be?

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:41.600
Souichi, what are you doing up there?

00:18:42.210 --> 00:18:43.910
Bro!

00:18:43.910 --> 00:18:45.560
You've gotta help me!

00:18:45.870 --> 00:18:50.300
I'm showing the little brat who's boss,
since he's been messing with my cedars!

00:18:50.300 --> 00:18:53.270
After this, I'm calling the cops on him. 
Got a problem with that?

00:18:53.700 --> 00:18:56.730
Do you have any proof
that my brother did this?

00:18:56.730 --> 00:18:59.600
How the hell isn't this rock-solid proof?!

00:18:59.600 --> 00:19:01.830
I see... You have a point.

00:19:01.830 --> 00:19:04.250
I'll go with him to the police, then.

00:19:04.810 --> 00:19:07.940
Yeah? You're the brat's brother, huh?

00:19:07.940 --> 00:19:09.200
All right, fair enough.

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:11.270
But if we speak to the police,

00:19:11.270 --> 00:19:13.920
I'll have to tell them about these traps, too.

00:19:14.390 --> 00:19:17.650
I wonder how they'd feel about you 
setting traps like this for people.

00:19:17.650 --> 00:19:18.650
What?

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:20.580
You trying to blackmail me?!

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:22.720
It's not blackmail. I'm stating facts.

00:19:23.150 --> 00:19:25.220
Screw with me, will you?!

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:26.980
Both of you, get out, now!

00:19:26.980 --> 00:19:29.610
If I catch either of you around
here again, you're dead!

00:19:32.140 --> 00:19:34.300
Come on, Souichi. Let's go home.

00:19:37.160 --> 00:19:40.340
Souichi, why do you cause 
so much trouble for us?

00:19:40.340 --> 00:19:43.350
He's right, Souichi. Show some remorse!

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:44.820
You tell him!

00:19:44.820 --> 00:19:47.070
Hey! I'm not done with you yet!

00:19:47.070 --> 00:19:48.230
Souichi!

00:19:48.230 --> 00:19:51.830
I don't have time to waste
listening to your rant, Dad.

00:19:52.560 --> 00:19:56.260
I have a cute friend in little toady here.

00:19:56.490 --> 00:19:57.850
Toady!

00:19:57.850 --> 00:20:00.020
It's been a while, huh?

00:20:00.020 --> 00:20:01.740
I'll let you out now.

00:20:01.740 --> 00:20:03.830
It's been a few days, huh?

00:20:03.830 --> 00:20:05.660
Toady!

00:20:15.700 --> 00:20:17.620
Rotted...

00:20:18.290 --> 00:20:20.030
Stinky!

00:20:20.030 --> 00:20:25.030
Collection No. 068

00:20:20.030 --> 00:20:25.030
<b>Souichi's Convenient Curses</b>

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:38.820
<i>I can't believe it...</i>

00:20:38.820 --> 00:20:41.460
<i>The thing I've feared has come true.</i>

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:46.000
Papa, you look so frightened. What's wrong?

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:48.720
Well, Papa?

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:52.100
Oh, it's nothing, Marie.

00:20:52.840 --> 00:20:54.150
<i>After all this time,</i>

00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:58.100
<i>my daughter has succumbed
to the doll transformation!</i>

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:05.070
Collection No. 090

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:05.070
<b>Hellish Doll Funeral</b>

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:07.330
Honey! Honey!

00:21:07.690 --> 00:21:10.330
Marie's completely turned into a doll now!

00:21:10.710 --> 00:21:11.670
Look!

00:21:11.670 --> 00:21:13.160
She can't even move!

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:16.290
She won't respond to me!

00:21:16.870 --> 00:21:18.900
<i>My darling daughter...</i>

00:21:19.470 --> 00:21:23.550
<i>Will you really never smile for us again?</i>

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:30.020
<i>Most people in this world put their children 
to rest once they've turned into dolls,</i>

00:21:30.020 --> 00:21:32.980
<i>but I can't understand that...</i>

00:21:32.980 --> 00:21:36.690
Let's keep Marie by our side.

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:41.150
<i>But Marie's changes didn't end there...</i>

00:21:41.600 --> 00:21:46.610
<i>And we began to understand how 
those parents must have felt.</i>

00:21:46.610 --> 00:21:47.970
Dear...

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:50.850
We should put her to rest.

00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:53.070
Yes...

00:23:34.990 --> 00:23:39.970
Collection
